sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / Client
    participant C as auth.controller
    participant U2 as User model
    participant E as Email service (Nodemailer)

    U->>C: POST /api/auth/register {name, email, password, phone}
    C->>C: validate required fields, password min 6, email format
    C->>U2: User.findOne({ email })
    U2-->>C: existing? -> 400
    C->>C: generate 32-byte token, store sha256 + 24h expiry
    C->>U2: User.create(...) -> bcrypt hash (pre-save hook, cost 12)
    C->>E: sendEmail(verify-link with raw token)
    E-->>C: false? delete user, 500
    C-->>U: 201 { user (unverified) }
    Note over U,E: User opens emailed link
    U->>C: GET /api/auth/verify-email/:token
    C->>C: sha256(token)
    C->>U2: findOne({ emailVerificationToken, expire > now })
    C->>U2: set isVerified = true, clear token fields, save
    C-->>U: 200 { verified }
    U->>C: POST /api/auth/login -> 200 { token, user }